    "date": 1711698930,
    "caption": "🛰 Dear friends, Astana Hub Drone Tech Center invites you to a Q&A session with representatives of Korean drone manufacturing companies!\n\n🇰🇷 Speakers from the Republic of Korea will discuss:\n\n🔹 Co-development for Kazakhstan Drones;\n🔹 UAS Localization;\n🔹 Acquiring Drone Technology;\n🔹 Technical Breakdown Structure for Drone System;\n🔹 Joint Development of UAVs;\n🔹 Education & Training Program.\n\nThe speakers have extensive experience with all types of UAVs, including fixed-wing, rotary-wing, multi-copter, aerostat, and VTOL aircraft, through participation in both local and international joint development projects.\n\n📍 The meeting will take place on April 3rd at 11:00, Astana Hub, Media hall.\n\n💥 We would like to remind you that on March 27, the opening of Drone Tech Center took place at the Astana Hub international tech park. \n\n🛸 Its activity is focused on creating a unique space for the exchange of experiences and ideas, as well as on the development of innovative solutions in the field of drone technologies.\n\n😉 Don’t miss the chance and dive into the world of drones! Register via the link in the profile description.",
